<view class="page page-with-bar edit-self-page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="surface-card">正在读取</view>

  <view wx:else class="surface-card edit-self-card">
    <view class="field edit-self-field">
      <view class="field-label">自我介绍</view>
      <textarea class="textarea edit-self-textarea" value="{{form.selfIntroduction}}" data-field="selfIntroduction" bindinput="updateField" maxlength="1000" placeholder="介绍你的服务方向、经验和合作方式" />
    </view>
    <view class="field row edit-self-switch-row">
      <view class="row-main">
        <view class="field-label">公开展示</view>
        <view class="row-meta">关闭后不会展示在公开资料中</view>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{form.visible}}" bindchange="updateVisible" />
    </view>
    <view class="field consult-fee-field">
      <view class="consult-fee-row">
        <view class="field-label">时薪</view>
        <view class="consult-fee-control">
          <input class="input consult-fee-input" type="digit" value="{{form.consultingFee}}" bindinput="updateConsultingFee" placeholder="250" />
          <view class="consult-fee-unit">元/小时</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="row-meta consult-fee-desc">1. 开启公开展示后，讲了么将提供简历托管与流量曝光服务，并按实际成交收取服务费。</view>
      <view class="row-meta consult-fee-desc">2. 为减少无效打扰，他人需先缴纳 2 小时试讲定金后才能查看你的手机号；该定金将自动抵扣服务费，你本人无需另行缴费。</view>
      <view class="row-meta consult-fee-desc">3. 缴费后，对方有权要求你提供 2 小时试讲服务；第 3 小时起可继续按时薪付费。</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="error-box">{{errorMessage}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="bottom-bar">
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saveButtonDisabled}}" bindtap="save">保存</button>
  </view>
</view>
